The first quest
The first quest is really very easy. You first go to the story mode, located in safe zone. Then you go to the memories of prehistory. Open the track menu with tab, and follow the instructions to get your first quest. When you have received it exit the story mode, then go to evermore train station.
You can go to the train station by traveling through evermore city, or you can use a teleporter and just teleport yourself there. After that buy a ticket, board the train, wait for the train to take you to crystal city, finally getting off the train on arrival platform. After that exit the platform, entering crystal city. Go to the library, clime to the second floor, read the scroll, then press shift enter to finish the quest.